      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْلَقٌ</span></b>  <i>A razor;</i> (K;) the <i>instrument of shaving.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِسَآءٌ مِحْلَقٌ</span> (S, K) (assumed tropical:)  <i>A
